      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 0,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "创新点",
          "line_tops": [
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 1,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 52,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "这篇论文的创新不在提出新模型，而在换掉评价标准：直接以下游治疗决策质量评价1型糖尿病（T1D）数字孪生。",
          "line_tops": [
            88,
            156,
            224
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 2,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 108,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "作者定义了两类指标——轨迹预测精度（RMSE）与治疗排序质量（Spearman秩相关）：孪生预测20个候选方案下的血糖轨迹，经血糖风险核打分后排序，与真实排序越一致，决策质量越高。评价指标怎么定义，直接决定选型方向。",
          "line_tops": [
            316,
            384,
            452,
            520,
            588
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "column": 1,
      "content_top": 0,
      "content_bottom": 1071.6875,
      "bottom_whitespace": 240.3125,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 4,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2,
          "page": 3,
          "text": "方法",
          "line_tops": [
            858.69
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 5,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 53,
          "page": 3,
          "text": "用FDA接受的UVA/Padova模拟器构造30名虚拟1型糖尿病患者，每人模拟21种基础-餐时胰岛素方案：",
          "line_tops": [
            944.69,
            1012.69
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        3
      ],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "column": 2,
      "content_top": 4,
      "content_bottom": 1172.5625,
      "bottom_whitespace": 139.4375,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 5,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 87,
          "page": 4,
          "text": "在一个方案的观测数据上拟合孪生，预测其余20个反事实方案，比较排序。",
          "line_tops": [
            4,
            72
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 7,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 92,
          "page": 4,
          "text": "六种方法同场比较：ReplayBG式贝叶斯辨识（MCMC）、仿真推断SBI、无迹卡尔曼滤波UKF、岭回归线性模型、多层感知机神经网络，以及完全不用个体数据的“平均患者”基线Prior。",
          "line_tops": [
            909.56,
            977.56,
            1045.56,
            1113.56
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        6
      ],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "column": 3,
      "content_top": 2,
      "content_bottom": 1116,
      "bottom_whitespace": 196,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 8,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "结果",
          "line_tops": [
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 9,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 98,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "预测精度与决策质量分道扬镳：平均患者基线精度最差（RMSE 63.6 mg/dL），排序却拿第二高（0.766）；黑箱神经网络精度几乎高一倍（RMSE 32.9），排序只有0.049，与随机无异。",
          "line_tops": [
            88,
            156,
            224,
            292
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 10,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 81,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "Friedman检验加多重校正的逐对Wilcoxon检验确认分离在30名患者上成立；SBI的0.728与平均患者基线无显著差异。两个指标下的方法排名出现明显翻转。",
          "line_tops": [
            384,
            452,
            520,
            588
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        11
      ],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "column": 4,
      "content_top": 2,
      "content_bottom": 1139.390625,
      "bottom_whitespace": 172.609375,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 12,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2,
          "page": 6,
          "text": "结论",
          "line_tops": [
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 13,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 91,
          "page": 6,
          "text": "只按轨迹精度选孪生，可能选出决策上接近随机的模型；决策质量必须直接评价，不会随精度提高自动到来。成本数据同样支持这一点：MCMC每名患者约8小时，线性模型2.4秒、神经网络0.1秒。",
          "line_tops": [
            88,
            156,
            224,
            292
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 15,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 48,
          "page": 6,
          "text": "证据边界：全部来自单一模拟器的回顾性仿真，30名虚拟患者，预印本未经同行评审；代码已公开可复现。",
          "line_tops": [
            781.39,
            849.39,
            917.39
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        14
      ],
      "source_visible": true
    }
  ],
